h","text":"では！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(。・ω・。)正義！"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-12254":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ( ∩ˇωˇ∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/06/03/2328059/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、やっと、16人のプリンシパル、全公演終了しました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで来てくださった皆さん、ほんとにありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでくれてたら本望です( ´^` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながら来れなかった皆さん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントとかで応援ありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"励ましになりました( ´^` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽、残念ながらニ幕に出演することはできなかったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも千秋楽の公演、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっちばん楽しかったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっちばんやり切ったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう悔いはないです！！うん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもなんでかしらないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果発表終わって楽屋戻ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大号泣しちゃって。(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しい思いもあったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わった安心感もあったと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣いたあとはすっきりしたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほら！この通り！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/06/03/2328059/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙で顔ぐちゃぐちゃー(´･∀･`)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この公演を通して、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の中で何かが変わった気がして。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長できた気がする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演技の楽しさを改めて学んだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しだけ堂々と自信を持つことができた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台で素を出すことができた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれはまだ完全ではなくて、不完全の状態。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回学んだことをどうやってこれからに繋げていけるか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"活かしていけるか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこが大事だと思ってるんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学んだだけで終わってはいけない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その次のステップに進むためのものだから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから私はこのまま進んでいきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分を出すことを恐れずに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほら、だって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明日も、生きていくんです。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/06/03/2328059/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はごめん、これだけ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クイズは次に回します！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/06/03/2328059/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし、テスト終わったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルも終わったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっくりしよーっと(o^^o)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのまえにまず学校だ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト返しに耐えてくる笑(´>∀<｀)ゝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break